      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16078a76825e9c9f",
      "translationZh": "Meta 发布了一篇很精彩的论文 https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.00206 ，但它没有考察 llama.cpp 支持的各种量化方式。所以，我随机抽取了 50 道 MATH-500 题目（ https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceH4/MATH-500 ），用 https://huggingface.co/bartowski/Qwen_Qwen3.5-4B-GGUF 的各种量化版本跑了一遍，并尝试了",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe6887780b0bdb7e",
      "translationZh": "这些对应于论文中的过度思考标记：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31f4577fed392750",
      "translationZh": "\" 是否\", \" 不确定\", \" 没把握\", \" 可能\", \" 也许会\",",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8449b567e0080e6e",
      "translationZh": "\" 可能会\", \" 另一个\", \" 不同的\", \" 重新考虑\", \" 重新思考\",",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b408517f0e64b57",
      "translationZh": "\" 回溯\", \" 重试\", \" 重新审视\", \" 怀疑\", \" 困惑\",",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae059a3eb55831df",
      "translationZh": "\" 错的\", \" 失误\", \" 错误\", \" 不正确的\"",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d7c31d0c191e161",
      "translationZh": "结果如下，令人意外的是，即使是 BF16 也能带来更高的准确率。需要注意的是，这只是在一个模型上进行的一次测试。试试看，看看它是否有帮助！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
